\begin_layout Standard
Because utility is increasing in 
\begin_inset Formula $c$
\end_inset

, the budget binds. After substituting 
\begin_inset Formula \[
c=y-pn-kH-\tfrac12H^2,
\]
\end_inset

the household maximizes 
\begin_inset Formula \[
W(n,H)=y+(6-p)n-\tfrac12n^2+(4-k)H-H^2
\]
\end_inset

subject to 
\begin_inset Formula \[
R(n,H):=y-1-pn-kH-\tfrac12H^2\ge0,\;n\ge0,\;H-sn\ge0,\;4n-H\ge0.
\]
\end_inset


\end_layout

